# The DSL serializer emits LF (core/flowlang/serialize.js), and the app rewrites
# a flow through it on every save. With core.autocrlf=true a Windows checkout
# hands back CRLF, so serialize(parse(file)) !== file for a file nobody has
# touched — which fails the shipped-flow byte-stability test and would show the
# first real edit as a whole-file diff. Pin the working copy to LF.
*.flow.yaml text eol=lf
